  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Support for Wan Smolbag Theatre Group, 2020-2025</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This activity&#xa0;provides continued support to the Wan Smolbag Group (WSB) in Vanuatu.&#xa0;WSB uses drama to inform, raise awareness and encourage public discussion on a range of contemporary health, lifestyle, environmental, and governance issues. WSB also delivers a range of community services and programmes through their Youth Centres, and sexual and reproductive health clinics.</narrative>
  </description>
